stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : OP-01: Create Reservation\n[Valid interval & resource exists]

    note right of DRAFT
        - Intent recorded
        - Resource NOT locked
        - Zero impact on OP-02 Availability
    end note

    DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : OP-03: Confirm Reservation\n[!resource.isLuxury & active & no conflict]
    DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL : OP-03: Confirm Reservation\n[resource.isLuxury & active]

    note right of PENDING_APPROVAL
        - Requires Approver authorization
        - Car not permanently locked
    end note

    PENDING_APPROVAL --> CONFIRMED : OP-05: Approve Reservation\n[Approver & currentTime < start & no conflict]
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : OP-06: Reject Reservation\n[Approver rejects request]
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> EXPIRED : System timeout\n[currentTime >= start without decision]

    note right of CONFIRMED
        - Binding allocation locked
        - Blocks availability under BR-02
    end note

    DRAFT --> CANCELLED : OP-04: Cancel Reservation\n[currentTime < start]
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED : OP-04: Cancel Reservation\n[currentTime < start]
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : OP-04: Cancel Reservation\n[currentTime < start]

    note right of CANCELLED
        - Allocation released
        - Terminal state
    end note

    CANCELLED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]